This repository is an independent reproduction and extension study built on:

- FuxiCTR and the official WWW 2025 MM-CTR challenge baseline.
- The MicroLens-1M benchmark dataset.
- An Apache-2.0 open implementation of the published Transformer-DCN Task 2 solution.

The fixed DIN evaluator, challenge data-loader conventions, and training entry-point
structure originate from the official baseline. Transformer_DCN.py reproduces and
adapts the published reference architecture. Original project contributions include
the embedding-side methods, Confidence-Aware Gated Fusion, controlled ablations,
pipeline integration, verification tooling, and documentation.

See docs/REFERENCES.md and docs/EVIDENCE_AND_ATTRIBUTION.md for source links and
the detailed ownership boundary. The MicroLens data are not redistributed here.
